Here is a self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Taito arcade game "A.D.E.R.S." (or a similar retro shooter) as a single-page web experience. It includes inline CSS and JavaScript, replicating the original sprite-based visuals, scoring, and mechanics.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ADERS · 1978 Taito Arcade</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #111;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #2a1a0e;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #3f2e1e, #1a0f07);
      padding: 20px 30px 30px;
      border-radius: 20px 20px 30px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 0 2px #b38b5b;
      border-bottom: 6px solid #b38b5b;
      transform: perspective(800px) rotateX(2deg);
    }
    .screen-wrapper {
      background: #0a0a0a;
      padding: 12px 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #f0e68c, 0 0 0 3px #6b4a2e;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      position: relative;
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 600px;
      height: 400px;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      background: #0f0f1a;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #b38b5b;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      color: #f0e68c;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 0 #6b4a2e;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      padding: 0 10px;
    }
    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .btn {
      background: #b38b5b;
      border: none;
      color: #1a0f07;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #6b4a2e, inset 0 2px 0 #f0e68c;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.05s linear;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .btn:active {
      transform: translateY(4px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 #6b4a2e, inset 0 2px 0 #f0e68c;
    }
    .score {
      background: #1a0f07;
      padding: 4px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 2px solid #b38b5b;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    .info {
      color: #b38b5b;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-top: 8px;
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .info span {
      color: #f0e68c;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cabinet">
  <div class="screen-wrapper">
    <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="600" height="400"></canvas>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">
    <div class="score" id="scoreDisplay">0000</div>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button class="btn" id="leftBtn">◄ LEFT</button>
      <button
